## Question
<!-- What are we trying to answer? -->

## Current hypothesis
<!-- Our current explanation. -->

## Figure of merit
<!-- The number we are trying to move, including its baseline value. -->

## Data and compute
<!-- Data locations, compute resources and constraints. -->

## Status
<!-- One line on where things stand. -->

## Next steps
- <!-- First step. -->
